CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.0
-------------------------

NEW FEATURES

    o Initial Bioconductor submission of PACMOSData.

    o Added ExperimentHub metadata for PACMOS reference datasets.

    o Added accessor function load_pacmos_data() for retrieving PACMOSData
      resources from ExperimentHub.

    o Added vignette demonstrating access to PACMOSData resources.
